<br><br>
COAL PREPARATION FACILITY
<br><br>
Fatal Powered Haulage Accident<br>
June 10, 2004
<br><br>
at
<br><br>
Tug Valley Coal Processing Company<br>
Tug Valley Coal Processing Company<br>
Naugatuck, Mingo County, West Virginia<br>
ID No.46-05890<br>
<br>
Accident Investigator<br>
<br>
Sherman L. Slaughter<br>
Mine Safety and Health Specialist/Accident Investigator
<br><br>
